[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13323.67, "timestamp": "03:42:03", "text": "サーバーはあと1日待つだけです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13326.71, "timestamp": "03:42:06", "text": "そして最後に、私が終わったとき、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13329.03, "timestamp": "03:42:09", "text": "サーバーを公開する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13331.51, "timestamp": "03:42:11", "text": "彼女はそれを公開し、サーバーに置いた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13333.91, "timestamp": "03:42:13", "text": "彼女の説明にあるリンクなどと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13338.71, "timestamp": "03:42:18", "text": "宣伝したら、たくさんの人が参加してくれた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13341.32, "timestamp": "03:42:21", "text": "それ以来ずっと。はい、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13342.55, "timestamp": "03:42:22", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13346.309, "timestamp": "03:42:26", "text": "あなたはSERマネージャーを雇うべきだった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13349.429, "timestamp": "03:42:29", "text": "それは痛みだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13359.11, "timestamp": "03:42:39", "text": "つまり、マネージャーがいるということは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13363.19, "timestamp": "03:42:43", "text": "相手にお金を払わなきゃいけないでしょ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13366.79, "timestamp": "03:42:46", "text": "その人は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13374.76, "timestamp": "03:42:54", "text": "はい、そうです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13377.11, "timestamp": "03:42:57", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13379.83, "timestamp": "03:42:59", "text": "そうですね、"}]